# Film 2 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in English: a picture marked up and sent back (story
# scripts/story/iduo-mark-en.json, FILM_LANG=en FILM_STORY=iduo-mark-en).
timeout 45000
until Message
# (the film once the app is on the screen as it stays: its first frames, as it starts, are none of the story)
wait 1200
at start
wait 1500
# (the list open over the chat as the outer screen lights: the chat tapped where it shows at the right, the list goes)
at tap=chat
tapxy 430 330
wait 1200
at tap=发消息
tap Message
wait 900
at type=The sign-in
type The sign-in
wait 700
at type= button is hard
type  button is hard
wait 800
at type= to see in dark
type  to see in dark
wait 750
at type= mode, fix it
type  mode, fix it
wait 650
at tap=send
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 500
at kb-down
tapxy 250 140
wait 600
at working
wait 2000
until Sign out
at answer
wait 1500
at unfold
log UNFOLD
wait 4500
at pic
tap img:after
wait 2000
at mark
nav over/mark 902 260
wait 900
at draw
drag 378 466 110 40 500
wait 900
at comment
wait 600
at keys
keys Still hard to read
wait 700
at note-done
tap Done
wait 900
at offer
tap Add to chat
wait 1200
at tap=send2
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 500
at working2
until Good catch
at fixed
wait 1500
at tap=合并
tap =Merge
until 4f2a9c1
at merged
wait 3200
at end
exit
